# Seen It's data is a record of what someone browsed. It belongs in a per-user
# folder (see README.md, "The data folder"), never in this repo - these lines
# make sure a data folder or a stray data file created here by mistake can
# never be committed.
data/
*-data/
seen-it-*.json
known-config.json
known-cache.json
.known-cache.json
.writing-*
# a helper settings file, if anyone points the settings folder here
config.json
node_modules/
